	"nodes":[
		{"id":"e6e47e7daeade205","type":"text","text":"# ⭐ **1. The Core Insight**\n\n24‑Game produces **moment states**. Moment Canvas Types define **moment shapes**.\n\nThe integration map shows:\n\n> **Which 24‑Game state produces which Moment Canvas Type.**\n\nThis is the missing bridge.\n\n# ⭐ **2. The Integration Table (the heart of the organ)**\n\nCode\n\n```\n24‑GAME STATE            →        MOMENT CANVAS TYPE\n--------------------------------------------------------------\nStillness                →        Static Canvas\nMotion                   →        Dynamic Canvas\nPressure                 →        Tension Canvas\nEcho                     →        Resonance Canvas\nOrientation              →        Navigation Canvas\nCommitment               →        Choice Canvas\nEntity Contact           →        Encounter Canvas\nTransition               →        Threshold Canvas\n```\n\nThis is the **canonical mapping**.\n\nEvery 24‑Game state has a **1:1 geometric expression**.\n\n# ⭐ **3. The Integration Loop (ASCII diagram)**\n\nThis is the full organ — the engine feeding the geometry feeding the flow.\n\nCode\n\n```\n                 ┌──────────────────────────────┐\n                 │          24‑GAME             │\n                 │   (moment physics engine)    │\n                 └──────────────┬───────────────┘\n                                │\n                                ▼\n                 ┌──────────────────────────────┐\n                 │     MOMENT CANVAS TYPES      │\n                 │   (moment geometry shapes)   │\n                 └──────────────┬───────────────┘\n                                │\n                                ▼\n                 ┌──────────────────────────────┐\n                 │     MOMENT CANVAS FLOW       │\n                 │   (moment choreography)      │\n                 └──────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\nThis is the **three‑layer moment organ**.\n\n# ⭐ **4. The Spicy Version (the real integration map)**\n\nThis is the one you actually wanted — the **full mapping with hinge behavior** included.\n\nCode\n\n```\n                         ┌─────────────── 24‑GAME ───────────────┐\n                         │                                        │\n                         │  Stillness     →   Static Canvas       │\n                         │  Motion        →   Dynamic Canvas      │\n                         │  Pressure      →   Tension Canvas      │\n                         │  Echo          →   Resonance Canvas    │\n                         │  Orientation   →   Navigation Canvas   │\n                         │  Commitment    →   Choice Canvas       │\n                         │  Entity        →   Encounter Canvas    │\n                         │  Transition    →   Threshold Canvas    │\n                         │                                        │\n                         └───────────────┬────────────────────────┘\n                                         │\n                                         ▼\n                         ┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n                         │        MOMENT CANVAS FLOW              │\n                         │   (double‑hinge loop + shear)          │\n                         └────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\nThis is the **moment engine → moment geometry → moment flow** pipeline.\n\nThis is Threshold’s **moment physics** in one diagram.\n\n# ⭐ **5. The Ultra‑Spicy Version (with hinge logic)**\n\nThis is the one that makes designers cry.\n\nCode\n\n```\n24‑GAME STATE  →  CANVAS TYPE  →  FLOW HINGE BEHAVIOR\n--------------------------------------------------------------\nStillness      →  Static       →  Low hinge activity\nMotion         →  Dynamic      →  Drift hinge activation\nPressure       →  Tension      →  Collapse hinge primed\nEcho           →  Resonance    →  Emotional hinge resonance\nOrientation    →  Navigation   →  Directional hinge rotation\nCommitment     →  Choice       →  Hinge snap / trapdoor\nEntity         →  Encounter    →  Identity hinge activation\nTransition     →  Threshold    →  Double‑hinge shear event\n```\n\nThis is the **moment‑level physics engine** in its final form.\n\n# ⭐ **6. The Final Integration Diagram (the one for your vault)**\n\nCode\n\n```\n                 ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n                 │                 24‑GAME                    │\n                 │      (moment physics: 8 states)            │\n                 └───────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\n                                 │\n                                 ▼\n                 ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n                 │           MOMENT CANVAS TYPES              │\n                 │   (8 geometries mapped 1:1 to states)      │\n                 └───────────────┬────────────────────────────┘\n                                 │\n                                 ▼\n                 ┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n                 │           MOMENT CANVAS FLOW               │\n                 │   (double‑hinge loop + shear + collapse)   │\n                 └────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\nThis is the **Moment Organ**. This is the **24‑Game integration**. This is the **spicy map** you asked for.","x":140,"y":-30,"width":760,"height":3290}
